{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And a man when it goes out.</b> This excludes a minor, and he does not leave the category of a minor until he is nine years and one day old." "<b>When it goes out from him.</b> Until its impurity goes out beyond his flesh. From here they said: a priest who is a zav and a priest who had a seminal emission, when his organs stirred — he holds the organ and swallows the terumah." "<b>And he shall wash.</b> In water, and even in the waters of a mikveh." "<b>All his flesh.</b> In water in which his entire body ascends. And how much is it? A cubit by a cubit at a height of three cubits, for thus did they measure the length and width of a man's entire body, and they estimated that it is forty se'ah."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:29.338545104Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}